       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NOTIC9.
      * CHARGE CHANGE NOTICE PERIOD CHECK
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-NOTICE-GIVEN-DAYS      PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CHANGE-ALLOWED         PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-NOTICE-GIVEN-DAYS
           PERFORM 2000-ALLOW
           DISPLAY 'ALLOWED: ' WS-CHANGE-ALLOWED
           STOP RUN.
       2000-ALLOW.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-CHANGE-ALLOWED
           IF WS-NOTICE-GIVEN-DAYS >= 30
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-CHANGE-ALLOWED
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'NOTICE CHECKED'.
